 "answer": "The parameter is **`context_window`**. In current LlamaIndex releases it's usually set in one of these places:\n\n- **On the LLM itself**, e.g. `OpenAI(model=\"...\", context_window=...)`. It's exposed through the LLM's `metadata` (`LLMMetadata.context_window`).\n- **Globally**, via `Settings.context_window` (with `Settings.num_output` for the reserved output tokens).\n- **On `PromptHelper`**, which uses it to decide how much text fits in a prompt.\n\nI'm less certain of the exact defaults and which integrations override them, so check the docs for your installed version.",
